    <forecast>
        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-10-28T21:16:31+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-28T21:16:31+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-28T10:46:31Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-28T10:46:31Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A high pressure system south of WA extends a ridge over southern parts of the state while a weak trough lies across central Australia near the norther border. The high will drift over the southeast on Thursday and into the Tasman Sea on Friday, allowing a trough and low pressure system to move across SA on Friday. A brief high pressure system settles over SA on Saturday before another trough and low starts to move across from WA on Sunday.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
        <area aac="SA_PW014" description="North East Pastoral" type="public-district" parent-aac="SA_FA001">
            <forecast-period index="0" start-time-local="2026-10-28T21:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-29T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-28T10:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-28T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. The chance of a thunderstorm north of Leigh Creek. Winds southeasterly 20 to 30 km/h.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-10-29T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-30T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-28T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-29T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Medium chance of showers north of Oodnadatta, near zero chance elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm north of Leigh Creek. Winds southeasterly 20 to 30 km/h turning east to northeasterly 25 to 40 km/h during the morning. Overnight temperatures falling to between 9 and 21 with daytime temperatures reaching 25 to 31.</text>
                <text type="fire_danger">Moderate</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 9:00am to 4:50pm, UV Index predicted to reach 11 [Extreme]</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-10-30T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-31T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-29T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-30T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. High chance of showers south of Leigh Creek, medium chance elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm. Winds east to northeasterly 15 to 20 km/h turning north to northwesterly 25 to 40 km/h during the morning then tending northwest to northeasterly 20 to 30 km/h in the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to between 14 and 21 with daytime temperatures reaching 29 to 35.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-10-31T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-01T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-30T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-31T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Sunny. Winds northwest to northeasterly 15 to 20 km/h tending west to southwesterly 25 to 35 km/h during the morning then tending south to southwesterly 20 to 30 km/h during the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to between 15 and 22 with daytime temperatures reaching 29 to 37.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="4" start-time-local="2026-11-01T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-11-02T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-31T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-11-01T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly sunny. The chance of morning fog south of Yunta. Slight chance of a shower south of Yunta in the afternoon and evening. Near zero chance of rain elsewhere. Winds southeast to southwesterly 15 to 20 km/h tending northeast to southeasterly 20 to 30 km/h during the morning then tending northwest to northeasterly 15 to 25 km/h during the day. Overnight temperatures falling to between 11 and 21 with daytime temperatures reaching 31 to 38.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
